cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this skill, please cite it."
title: "academic-deai: 中英文学术写作去AI化与去防御性表述"
abstract: >
  An Agent Skills-compatible skill that removes AI-generated language patterns
  and defensive hedging from academic prose in Chinese and English, while
  preserving evidence-appropriate caution and all numerical, formula, and
  citation content. Includes a zero-dependency bilingual scanner (scan.py)
  and a protected-content diff checker (diffcheck.py).
